<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Smart Swimming Pool – Monitoring</title><link>https://smart-swimmingpool.github.io/tags/monitoring/</link><description>Recent content in Monitoring on Smart Swimming Pool</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://smart-swimmingpool.github.io/tags/monitoring/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Grafana Dashboard</title><link>https://smart-swimmingpool.github.io/docs/grafana-dashboard/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://smart-swimmingpool.github.io/docs/grafana-dashboard/</guid><description>
&lt;h1&gt;\ud83d\udcc Grafana Dashboard&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Grafana Dashboard&lt;/strong&gt; provides beautiful visualization of your pool data, allowing you to track temperature trends, system status, and historical data over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;\ud83d\udca1 Overview&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="ud83dudca1-overview"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#ud83dudca1-overview" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Grafana Dashboard offers:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Temperature Visualization&lt;/strong&gt;: Track pool and solar temperatures over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Historical Data&lt;/strong&gt;: View trends and patterns in your pool data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Monitoring&lt;/strong&gt;: Monitor pump status, uptime, and other metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customizable&lt;/strong&gt;: Adapt the dashboard to your specific needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real-Time Updates&lt;/strong&gt;: Live data from your pool controller via MQTT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alerting&lt;/strong&gt;: Set up notifications for specific conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;\ud83d\udcc Key Features&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="ud83dudcc-key-features"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#ud83dudcc-key-features" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;\u2705 &lt;strong&gt;Temperature Charts&lt;/strong&gt;: Beautiful graphs showing temperature trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;\u2705 &lt;strong&gt;Pump Status&lt;/strong&gt;: Visual indication of pump operation times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;\u2705 &lt;strong&gt;System Health&lt;/strong&gt;: Monitor controller uptime and connectivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;\u2705 &lt;strong&gt;Custom Panels&lt;/strong&gt;: Add or modify panels to suit your needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;\u2705 &lt;strong&gt;Time Range Selection&lt;/strong&gt;: View data from hours to months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;\u2705 &lt;strong&gt;Export/Import&lt;/strong&gt;: Share your dashboard configuration with others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;\u2705 &lt;strong&gt;Open Source&lt;/strong&gt;: MIT License, free to use and modify&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
